  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 1505701,
      "startingMessageId": [
        150570101
      ],
      "messages": {
        "150570101": {
          "id": 150570101,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Hey, {NICKNAME}, {F#girl}{M#dude}!",
          "next": [
            150570102
          ]
        },
        "150570102": {
          "id": 150570102,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your message came in right as I was looking for you",
          "next": [
            150570103
          ]
        },
        "150570103": {
          "id": 150570103,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "We've always been on the same wavelength",
          "next": [
            150570104
          ]
        },
        "150570104": {
          "id": 150570104,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Got something you'll like to hear",
          "next": [
            150570105
          ]
        },
        "150570105": {
          "id": 150570105,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Our book is selling pretty well! Once this money gets transferred over, those kids will be a giant step closer to living their dreams",
          "next": [
            150570106,
            150570107
          ]
        },
        "150570106": {
          "id": 150570106,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "That's really great! Hope everything goes smoothly",
          "next": [
            150570108
          ]
        },
        "150570107": {
          "id": 150570107,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You've really pushed hard to get this project going",
          "next": [
            150570108
          ]
        },
        "150570108": {
          "id": 150570108,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "But I'm still a little curious, what are you doing all this for?",
          "next": [
            150570109
          ]
        },
        "150570109": {
          "id": 150570109,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I know you like kids, but I never imagined you would push yourself so hard over an imaginary starship",
          "next": [
            150570110
          ]
        },
        "150570110": {
          "id": 150570110,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Haha, I still think Swooshy is much harder to get to know",
          "next": [
            150570111
          ]
        },
        "150570111": {
          "id": 150570111,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Sure I created it, but I honestly can't figure out why it's willing to stick with me through everything",
          "next": [
            150570112
          ]
        },
        "150570112": {
          "id": 150570112,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "It's made up of Wishpower from a distant planet, but it has never been to that planet. Plus, there's absolutely no way imagenae could reach a place that far out",
          "next": [
            150570113
          ]
        },
        "150570113": {
          "id": 150570113,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "As for the so-called \"Interstellar,\" there's no way Swooshy could ever steer that starship into space, not even if it gets completed a few decades down the line",
          "next": [
            150570114
          ]
        },
        "150570114": {
          "id": 150570114,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "It is well aware of this point",
          "next": [
            150570115
          ]
        },
        "150570115": {
          "id": 150570115,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "But it still refers to itself as \"Captain,\" and still works away toward an unattainable future",
          "next": [
            150570116
          ]
        },
        "150570116": {
          "id": 150570116,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "It's only today, after seeing the kids' latest artwork, that ol' Sampo finally completely understood Swooshy",
          "next": [
            150570117
          ]
        },
        "150570117": {
          "id": 150570117,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "The future the kids dream of is truly dazzling, really touching",
          "next": [
            150570118
          ]
        },
        "150570118": {
          "id": 150570118,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Captain Swooshy must want to make this the predestined future",
          "next": [
            150570119,
            150570120
          ]
        },
        "150570119": {
          "id": 150570119,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I totally get it now. Doing all this is definitely worth it",
          "next": [
            150570121
          ]
        },
        "150570120": {
          "id": 150570120,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "I still don't understand",
          "next": [
            150570121
          ]
        },
        "150570121": {
          "id": 150570121,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Sure, there are only a handful of places in the cosmos where Wishpower can physically manifest, but there are actually places out there where Wishpower pretty impressive!",
          "next": [
            150570122
          ]
        },
        "150570122": {
          "id": 150570122,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "\"Wishes\" are the greatest energy source humanity can create, more powerful than nuclear energy, more powerful than Imaginary energy",
          "next": [
            150570123
          ]
        },
        "150570123": {
          "id": 150570123,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "It can take specks of starlight bound by the shackles of fate in the abyss, and transform them into dazzling fireworks that soar into the sky. It can make a lost kid gaze at the distant sea of stars and believe that one day, they'll reach an unprecedented, magnificent future",
          "next": [
            150570124
          ]
        },
        "150570124": {
          "id": 150570124,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Perhaps still, the fleeting flash of light the children see in the vast sea of stars is just the afterglow of Miss Himeko and the Nameless departing once more.",
          "next": [
            150570125,
            150570127
          ]
        },
        "150570125": {
          "id": 150570125,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Well said, very eloquent",
          "next": [
            150570126
          ]
        },
        "150570126": {
          "id": 150570126,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Aw heck, {F#girl}{M#dude}, you're gonna make me blush",
          "next": [
            150570129
          ]
        },
        "150570127": {
          "id": 150570127,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Why so sentimental all of a sudden?",
          "next": [
            150570128
          ]
        },
        "150570128": {
          "id": 150570128,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Aw, I'm getting old, you know",
          "next": [
            150570129
          ]
        },
        "150570129": {
          "id": 150570129,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1108,
          "text": "Alrighty then, ol' Sampo's off, lots to do",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        1108,
        8001
      ]
    }
  ]
}